WEBVTT

00:23.396 --> 00:27.656
[MIKASA gasps] It's him.
That was Eren's voice!

00:27.736 --> 00:31.116
[EREN]
My name is Eren Jaeger.

00:31.196 --> 00:34.116
I'm addressing my fellow
Subjects of Ymir.

00:34.196 --> 00:38.036
Speaking to you directly through
the power of the Founder.

00:38.126 --> 00:40.246
All the walls on
the island of Paradis

00:40.336 --> 00:42.456
have crumbled to the ground,

00:42.546 --> 00:47.466
and the legions of Titans buried
within have begun their march.

00:47.546 --> 00:50.136
My only goal is to protect

00:50.216 --> 00:52.176
the lives of the
people of Paradis,

00:52.256 --> 00:55.306
the island where I was born.

00:55.386 --> 00:58.476
Right now, the nations of
the world are united

00:58.556 --> 01:01.816
in their desire to
exterminate my people,

01:01.896 --> 01:04.396
and it won't end
with our island.

01:04.476 --> 01:06.026
They won't be satisfied until

01:06.106 --> 01:09.026
every last Subject
of Ymir is dead.

01:09.106 --> 01:12.446
I won't let them have their way.

01:12.526 --> 01:15.996
The Titans of the Walls
will continue their march

01:16.076 --> 01:20.536
until every trace of life beyond
our shores is trampled flat

01:20.626 --> 01:25.706
and the people of Paradis are
all that remains of humanity.

01:26.966 --> 01:31.966
♪ Opening Song ♪

03:10.186 --> 03:10.936
[ELDIANS gasp]

03:11.026 --> 03:12.566
What the?

03:12.646 --> 03:14.566
Wait, where did we
all go just now?

03:14.656 --> 03:17.946
Mister Leonhart?
Are you alright over there?

03:18.866 --> 03:21.246
[ANNIE'S FATHER]
Yes, but did you hear him?

03:21.326 --> 03:26.336
The Titans from that island
are on their way to kill us all.

03:32.466 --> 03:37.466
[GABI]
Falco! Where are you?

03:37.546 --> 03:38.506
We're here!

03:38.596 --> 03:41.716
If you can hear me,
say something!

03:41.806 --> 03:44.686
Becoming one of the
Nine is a real ordeal.

03:44.766 --> 03:46.146
It leaves you helpless.

03:46.226 --> 03:49.106
It screws up your memories, too.

03:49.186 --> 03:51.026
There's no way they
wouldn't have grabbed him.

03:51.106 --> 03:53.106
But why? Who's "they"?

03:53.186 --> 03:57.026
I'm gonna guess Jean and Conny
saw how everything went down

03:57.116 --> 04:00.486
and realized Falco was far
too important to leave behind.

04:00.576 --> 04:02.786
They'll bring him back
to the Scouts.

04:04.406 --> 04:06.626
[REINER] They know he's
got one of the Nine.

04:06.706 --> 04:08.416
There's no way they'd let him--

04:08.496 --> 04:09.836
[REINER groans]

04:09.916 --> 04:13.506
What's wrong, Reiner?
Did you use up all your power?

04:13.586 --> 04:19.506
[REINER] Yeah. My armor came
undone right as the wall fell.

04:19.596 --> 04:21.636
A chunk of it hit me dead-on.

04:25.596 --> 04:27.936
[REINER]
I couldn't stop him.

04:28.016 --> 04:29.226
Huh?

04:30.726 --> 04:32.186
It's over.

04:32.276 --> 04:34.896
Eren's about to
destroy the world.

04:47.206 --> 04:52.296
South of here we have
airships ready to escape.

04:52.376 --> 04:56.676
Find Pieck, or anyone who's
still alive and flee the island.

04:57.926 --> 05:02.506
You have to go warn
Marley and the world.

05:02.596 --> 05:04.426
Fast as you can.

05:05.426 --> 05:07.516
What does it matter
if we warn them?

05:07.596 --> 05:09.646
They have nowhere to run.

05:11.816 --> 05:14.356
My mom and dad and Aunt Karina.

05:14.436 --> 05:17.566
They're gonna die along with
everybody else in Marley.

05:19.196 --> 05:20.196
That's right.

05:20.276 --> 05:22.776
Then we need to
kill Eren and save them!

05:22.866 --> 05:25.196
We can't do that.

05:25.286 --> 05:27.196
The Founder's control
over all Titans

05:27.286 --> 05:29.536
and Subjects of Ymir
is absolute.

05:29.626 --> 05:32.076
There's no way
we can stop Eren now.

05:34.876 --> 05:36.876
The war's been decided.

05:36.956 --> 05:39.176
There's no winning.

05:39.256 --> 05:44.306
But if you keep moving,
maybe you'll see the aftermath.

05:44.386 --> 05:47.426
[Gasps] Wait, Reiner.

05:57.066 --> 05:59.896
[GABI] No way am I
just letting this happen.

06:02.236 --> 06:04.826
Hang on, Falco. I'm coming.

06:11.956 --> 06:13.416
[JEAN]
It's over.

06:15.086 --> 06:17.506
[JEAN] Maniac or not,
I never thought Eren would

06:17.586 --> 06:21.626
slaughter everyone
who lives outside the walls.

06:21.716 --> 06:23.546
But when he's done,

06:23.636 --> 06:27.176
everyone who hates us
will be dead.

06:27.256 --> 06:31.136
The entire outside world
was a threat to our existence,

06:31.226 --> 06:35.516
and now it's going to be
trampled flat and left empty.

06:35.606 --> 06:38.106
These people called us
"island devils."

06:38.186 --> 06:41.856
Said we'd kill them all,
unless they killed us first.

06:41.946 --> 06:43.736
We became what
they thought we were,

06:43.816 --> 06:45.656
and we're doing what
they feared we'd do,

06:45.736 --> 06:47.996
because we have to.

06:48.076 --> 06:50.746
In the end, it's on them.

06:50.826 --> 06:51.866
This is only happening because

06:51.956 --> 06:54.746
the world picked
a fight and lost.

06:54.826 --> 06:55.916
There wasn't anything that we

06:55.996 --> 06:59.166
could have done
differently, was there?

07:01.296 --> 07:05.136
[ARMIN]
But even so...

07:05.216 --> 07:07.676
Eren is going too far.

07:07.756 --> 07:11.136
He's committing genocide
against the world.

07:11.226 --> 07:14.266
[JEAN]
Well, then. What do we do?

07:14.346 --> 07:16.106
Should we stop him?

07:17.476 --> 07:19.106
Think on it.

07:19.186 --> 07:20.776
Eren tricked Zeke
and kept him from

07:20.856 --> 07:24.276
castrating us all with
his euthanization plan.

07:24.356 --> 07:27.066
And Historia could've
taken the Founder,

07:27.156 --> 07:30.786
but Eren opposed that 'cause
it would've cost her life.

07:30.866 --> 07:34.746
He did this for his friends.

07:34.826 --> 07:36.576
Eren wants to protect us,
even if it means

07:36.666 --> 07:39.876
killing everybody else
on the planet.

07:39.956 --> 07:41.706
He's doing something
more horrible

07:41.796 --> 07:45.926
than we could imagine,
for our sakes.

07:46.006 --> 07:48.256
Because you're important to me.

07:48.346 --> 07:50.306
More than anyone else.

08:02.936 --> 08:04.146
[ALL gasp]

08:04.236 --> 08:06.156
What was that?

08:06.236 --> 08:10.036
Wait a sec. The Titans are
going after our soldiers?

08:10.116 --> 08:12.326
Did all the Marleyan
troops get eaten?

08:13.196 --> 08:15.916
But why? Eren's using
the Founder's power.

08:15.996 --> 08:18.456
He should have total control
over all these Titans!

08:18.536 --> 08:20.046
Who cares why?
They're eating us!

08:20.126 --> 08:21.376
Let's go and help!

08:21.456 --> 08:25.626
[MIKASA] Jean, wait!
What'll you do with the kid?

08:26.756 --> 08:28.586
I don't know,
but when he turned,

08:28.676 --> 08:31.216
I think he ate the Jaw Titan.

08:31.306 --> 08:32.886
That means we can use him,

08:32.966 --> 08:35.846
feed him to one of our guys
who Zeke transformed.

08:35.936 --> 08:38.556
We can bring someone back.

08:38.646 --> 08:40.816
If we find
Commander Pyxis, then--

08:40.896 --> 08:45.186
[CONNY]
No. We save my mom.

08:45.276 --> 08:47.736
Take him to Ragako
and feed him to her.

08:49.406 --> 08:50.866
All right?

08:53.236 --> 08:54.866
Wait a sec. Guys.

08:54.946 --> 08:56.156
Zeke told us this kid was

08:56.246 --> 08:57.826
one of Marley's
Warrior candidates,

08:57.916 --> 08:59.206
and that Reiner and
the rest of his unit

08:59.286 --> 09:01.086
all treat him like
their little brother.

09:01.166 --> 09:02.916
The war is basically over now.

09:03.006 --> 09:04.666
Marley is about
to be trampled flat,

09:04.756 --> 09:06.046
which means Reiner
and the Cart have

09:06.126 --> 09:08.586
nothing to fight for unless
we give them something.

09:08.676 --> 09:09.756
If we kill their friend now,

09:09.836 --> 09:11.006
we'll be offering
the two of them

09:11.096 --> 09:13.216
a whole new reason to
keep coming after us,

09:13.306 --> 09:15.346
and we get nothing
out of it. Please--

09:15.426 --> 09:18.476
What? You think bringing
my mom back is "nothing"?

09:18.556 --> 09:20.266
That's not what I meant to--

09:20.346 --> 09:21.766
For four years,
I've had to watch her

09:21.856 --> 09:23.896
lie helpless in
the ruins of my home.

09:23.976 --> 09:26.606
Do you have any idea
what that's like?

09:26.686 --> 09:27.986
You ate Bertholdt.

09:28.066 --> 09:30.486
That's why you're
still with us, right?

09:30.566 --> 09:32.446
Well, my mom can
be with us too, now!

09:32.526 --> 09:34.236
--Don't you dare--
--[MIKASA] Conny!

09:38.536 --> 09:39.576
[Gasps]

09:41.916 --> 09:43.666
Stop!

09:43.746 --> 09:44.546
Conny, wait!

09:44.626 --> 09:46.456
[JEAN]
Too late!

09:46.546 --> 09:47.796
Shit.

09:47.876 --> 09:50.466
There's no walls to
keep the Titans off us now.

09:50.546 --> 09:52.716
We're gonna have to
take all of them out.

09:57.266 --> 09:59.346
[VOLUNTEER 81A]
It's just a matter of time now.

09:59.436 --> 10:01.016
We gotta get out of here!

10:01.096 --> 10:03.436
Yelena! It's not safe!

10:03.516 --> 10:05.646
[YELENA]
Zeke summoned all these Titans.

10:05.726 --> 10:06.856
Huh?

10:07.986 --> 10:09.656
[YELENA]
So, why?

10:09.736 --> 10:12.946
Why would he allow them
to come after us?

10:21.916 --> 10:22.996
[CADETS scream]

10:23.076 --> 10:24.836
They broke through!

10:28.506 --> 10:31.006
It's over. We're dead.

10:32.756 --> 10:35.966
Don't slow down!
Stick to the narrow alleyways!

10:37.596 --> 10:40.476
[roars]

10:40.556 --> 10:42.396
Kaya! Watch out!

10:45.356 --> 10:48.106
--Kaya!
--We have to keep running!

10:48.186 --> 10:49.436
No!

10:59.656 --> 11:02.826
Please, no. Not again.

11:10.336 --> 11:13.136
Where are you, Sasha?
Please don't let it eat me!

11:13.216 --> 11:15.636
Kaya!

11:16.806 --> 11:19.556
[Roars]

11:19.636 --> 11:20.766
[KAYA screams]

11:21.726 --> 11:23.556
[ALL gasp]

11:29.106 --> 11:31.316
Kaya! Get up!

11:34.236 --> 11:37.446
[Yells]

11:53.796 --> 11:56.716
Sasha. You came.

12:02.016 --> 12:08.476
[KAYA crying]

12:08.566 --> 12:11.396
Weren't you going to evacuate
with the Warrior Unit?

12:11.476 --> 12:12.736
What are you doing here?

12:12.816 --> 12:15.106
I decided I couldn't
leave without Falco.

12:15.196 --> 12:16.446
That's Ben, innit?

12:16.526 --> 12:19.366
[SCOUT 81A] Hey! You guys
all right down there?

12:19.446 --> 12:22.036
[SCOUT 81B] Did you kill
the Titan yourselves?

12:22.116 --> 12:23.826
[SCOUT 81A]
What's that weapon you've got?

12:23.906 --> 12:26.116
Did the girl fire it?

12:26.206 --> 12:29.916
Hold on. Is she that
Marleyan infiltrator?

12:33.706 --> 12:35.876
Answer him or I will fire.

12:35.966 --> 12:37.466
No, she's not!

12:37.546 --> 12:41.176
She's my sister and our family
runs the stables to the south!

12:41.256 --> 12:42.926
Kaya.

12:43.016 --> 12:45.386
And I was the one
who fired the shot!

12:45.476 --> 12:48.726
I'm a former prisoner of war,
so I know how to use this thing!

12:48.806 --> 12:49.856
We ain't any threat to y'all,

12:49.936 --> 12:51.436
so how 'bout you
point those guns away

12:51.526 --> 12:53.226
and help get us to safety?

12:53.316 --> 12:54.736
Help, Mister Soldier!

12:54.816 --> 12:58.236
[ALL yelling]

12:58.316 --> 12:59.696
[GABI]
You guys...

12:59.776 --> 13:03.116
[ARTUR] Please, just get us
somewhere we can lay low.

13:03.196 --> 13:04.656
Easy, we'll get you out.

13:04.746 --> 13:06.786
We can guide you
around the flames.

13:07.706 --> 13:08.996
It'll be all right.

13:09.076 --> 13:11.666
You and Ben are gonna
make it out of all this,

13:11.746 --> 13:13.256
but for the time bein',
you're gonna have to

13:13.336 --> 13:15.756
stick with us and
keep your head down.

13:15.836 --> 13:17.006
Right.

13:18.966 --> 13:20.846
[SCOUT 81A]
I have to ask.

13:20.926 --> 13:22.886
Did all of you have
that daydream, too?

13:22.966 --> 13:26.136
Yeah. Was it true about
the Titans in the walls

13:26.226 --> 13:28.056
stompin' the whole world flat?

13:28.146 --> 13:30.396
[SCOUT 81B]
Yep. Seems to be.

13:34.106 --> 13:38.106
So, uh, why did you
cover for me?

13:39.486 --> 13:42.326
I can't explain it. And you?

13:42.406 --> 13:44.486
Why would you wanna save me?

13:44.576 --> 13:47.576
You know, you could have died.

13:48.996 --> 13:51.166
Not sure.

13:51.246 --> 13:54.956
Earlier. I tried to
stab you in the neck.

13:55.046 --> 13:58.296
Maybe I really am a devil.

14:01.176 --> 14:04.676
[GABI]
No. The only devil here is me.

14:04.766 --> 14:06.556
[Gasps]

14:06.636 --> 14:09.806
[GABI] I've killed
so many people in my life

14:09.896 --> 14:12.936
just because I wanted praise.

14:13.016 --> 14:16.526
It's sick. It's the devil in me.

14:18.066 --> 14:19.816
[NICOLO]
There's a devil in me, too.

14:19.906 --> 14:20.986
[Gasps]

14:21.066 --> 14:24.406
And in you, Kaya,
and in everyone else.

14:24.486 --> 14:26.786
That's why our world's
the way it is.

14:26.866 --> 14:29.206
There's a devil inside us all.

14:29.286 --> 14:33.076
But if that's true,
then what do we do?

14:33.166 --> 14:36.416
We get out of the forest.

14:36.506 --> 14:41.716
Maybe we'll fail, but we
still have to keep trying.

14:41.796 --> 14:44.466
[Screams] Help me!

14:44.546 --> 14:45.926
[CADET 73C]
Surma!

14:46.006 --> 14:51.476
[SURMA screaming]

14:56.186 --> 14:58.316
You okay, Surma?

14:58.396 --> 15:01.316
[KEITH] I taught you punks
a dozen ways to deal with Titans

15:01.406 --> 15:04.776
and whimpering like infants
isn't one of 'em!

15:04.866 --> 15:09.366
We've still got some old ODM
gear lying around, so suit up!

15:09.446 --> 15:11.536
You wanna see
the other side of this?

15:11.616 --> 15:14.326
Get off your sorry asses
and follow me!

15:14.416 --> 15:16.836
Commandant Shadis,
you're alive!

15:32.096 --> 15:34.436
Are there any more
survivors in there?

15:34.516 --> 15:35.976
Gather at the top floor!

15:36.056 --> 15:37.816
We need to draw
the Titans into a group

15:37.896 --> 15:39.856
so we can hit them all at once!

15:39.936 --> 15:42.276
Get all the Thunder
Spears up there, too!

15:42.356 --> 15:44.486
Whatever you've got,
we'll make it work!

15:44.566 --> 15:46.986
Don't let any of
the Titans wander off!

15:47.066 --> 15:49.656
These are the people
you trained and fought with!

15:49.736 --> 15:52.246
They need us to
put them to rest!

16:03.466 --> 16:05.336
Now! All at once!

16:07.886 --> 16:12.096
[JEAN]
Fire!

16:22.686 --> 16:25.066
Here they come! Pull back!

16:28.026 --> 16:28.906
[KEITH]
This way!

16:28.986 --> 16:30.486
[CADETS]
Sir!

16:30.576 --> 16:32.496
There's no need for
any of you to fight.

16:32.576 --> 16:34.456
Just lead 'em to the fort!

16:53.726 --> 16:54.886
[ARMIN gasps]

16:59.016 --> 17:00.936
[ARMIN]
Commander Pyxis.

17:17.116 --> 17:18.496
Let's go.

17:21.996 --> 17:24.546
Commander, we would
never have been able to

17:24.626 --> 17:27.626
make it this far without you.

17:32.506 --> 17:36.016
[ARMIN] So, thank you,
and rest in peace.

17:40.436 --> 17:42.066
[SCOUTS yell]

17:47.816 --> 17:49.026
[LOUISE yells]

18:07.166 --> 18:08.376
[LOUISE yells]

18:29.566 --> 18:32.276
[JEAN] The fires have
mostly died down.

18:32.366 --> 18:35.036
Marley's troops were
pretty much wiped out,

18:35.116 --> 18:37.996
and the Pure Titans
are all gone.

18:38.076 --> 18:40.286
For the moment, we're safe.

18:41.076 --> 18:42.626
[ONYANKOPON]
I see.

18:44.496 --> 18:46.246
If we're out of danger,

18:46.336 --> 18:49.086
you've got time to
talk about the daydream.

18:49.166 --> 18:52.636
What'd he say?
What's Eren trying to do?

18:53.506 --> 18:55.806
We're watching him do it.

18:57.386 --> 18:59.016
Is that so?

19:00.766 --> 19:04.686
Then my homeland
is doomed as well.

19:08.026 --> 19:10.566
[JAEGERIST 81A]
Floch! Are you okay?

19:10.646 --> 19:14.866
Yeah, no thanks to the wall
crumbling under my feet.

19:14.946 --> 19:18.286
Good job mopping up all
the Pure Titans for us, Jean.

19:19.286 --> 19:20.576
You survived.

19:20.656 --> 19:23.916
Damn. No need to sound
so excited about it.

19:23.996 --> 19:26.416
You should know
I'm not ready to die just yet.

19:26.496 --> 19:27.666
Not before I finally get to see

19:27.746 --> 19:30.546
the rebirth of
the Eldian Empire.

19:36.886 --> 19:40.226
[FLOCH]
Yelena. Gather the Volunteers.

19:40.306 --> 19:41.926
You're all under arrest.

19:42.016 --> 19:44.266
--[Gasps]
--Hey, what are you doing?

19:46.146 --> 19:47.936
Glad you're here, Mister Braus.

19:48.026 --> 19:49.566
Good to see you.

19:49.646 --> 19:52.946
And I'm glad y'all
made it through okay.

19:53.026 --> 19:55.066
Apologies for givin' you
even more to deal with.

19:55.156 --> 19:58.616
[ARMIN gasps] It's you.
Why are you here?

19:58.696 --> 19:59.996
Believe me.

20:00.076 --> 20:02.326
I'm not gonna make
any more trouble.

20:02.406 --> 20:04.286
I just want my friend back.

20:04.366 --> 20:06.206
So please. Let Falco go.

20:06.286 --> 20:07.746
[ARMIN gasps]

20:07.836 --> 20:10.296
[GABI] I swear, you'll never
hear from either of us again!

20:12.546 --> 20:16.796
[Gasps] Where is he?
What's wrong?

20:20.926 --> 20:24.556
[GABI] So, his mom got
transformed into a Titan

20:24.636 --> 20:28.476
and he's gonna have her
eat Falco? But why?

20:28.566 --> 20:30.646
When Conny's mom got turned,

20:30.726 --> 20:32.566
the limbs on her
Titan body were so weak

20:32.646 --> 20:35.236
she couldn't even roll over.

20:35.316 --> 20:38.816
We left her, and for four years,
Conny's been visiting her...

20:38.906 --> 20:40.656
Wait, four years?

20:45.786 --> 20:48.246
[GABI]
I'm so sorry.

20:50.296 --> 20:54.796
[GABI] But still,
I can't let Falco die for it!

20:56.586 --> 20:57.586
Why do this?

20:57.676 --> 20:59.216
Can't Eren Jaeger
just use his power

20:59.296 --> 21:01.426
to turn Conny's mother
back to normal?

21:01.516 --> 21:02.846
They say that the
Founder's supposed to

21:02.926 --> 21:04.846
be able to do anything, right?

21:04.926 --> 21:08.346
I can't say for sure,
but if Eren could do that,

21:08.436 --> 21:10.146
I think he would've done it
for our comrades

21:10.226 --> 21:11.526
that Zeke turned into Titans,

21:11.606 --> 21:13.106
instead of leaving them
for us to kill.

21:13.186 --> 21:14.146
If you don't know for sure,

21:14.236 --> 21:16.276
then why can't you
go and ask him?

21:16.356 --> 21:17.696
Does every person
beyond the shores

21:17.776 --> 21:19.866
of the island
really need to die?

21:19.946 --> 21:22.486
He doesn't have to
go that far, does he?

21:22.576 --> 21:26.076
Ask him why he doesn't just
destroy all the military bases!

21:26.156 --> 21:27.456
Isn't that enough?

21:27.536 --> 21:29.956
He had the power to
strip the Armor off Reiner!

21:30.036 --> 21:31.456
Don't tell me he can't!

21:31.546 --> 21:32.626
[Gasps]

21:32.706 --> 21:33.836
Can you tell us
where Reiner is now?

21:33.916 --> 21:35.376
[GABI]
What does it even matter?

21:35.466 --> 21:37.716
He got hit by a chunk of the
wall and he's too hurt to move!

21:37.796 --> 21:38.926
[ARMIN]
You're telling us that Reiner's

21:39.006 --> 21:40.466
hardening came undone?

21:40.546 --> 21:43.306
When? When did it happen?

21:43.386 --> 21:46.226
He said it fell off him
as the walls were collapsing.

21:46.306 --> 21:47.596
[ARMIN gasps]

21:47.686 --> 21:49.096
Does that mean...

21:49.186 --> 21:51.686
When he brought
the walls down.

21:51.766 --> 21:55.486
He did it by breaking
all Titan hardening everywhere.

21:55.566 --> 21:59.486
[ANNIE coughing]

22:09.956 --> 22:14.956
♪ Ending Song ♪

23:41.006 --> 23:42.676
[NARRATOR]
They were once friends,

23:42.756 --> 23:44.676
and they were once enemies.

23:44.756 --> 23:48.806
Time is set back in motion,
and with it comes change.

23:48.886 --> 23:51.976
The time to choose has arrived.

23:52.056 --> 23:54.936
Next episode: "Sunset."
